%% TRIP-004 Admin: aircraft
flowchart TD
    Table[Card Plan: table of aircraft<br/>R1, R2] --> New[Lägg till plan<br/>R3]
    Table --> Edit[Pencil<br/>R8]
    Table --> Trash[Trash can<br/>R9]
    New --> Form[Form: name, classes, add-ons]
    Edit --> Form
    Form --> Cls[Add, change or remove classes<br/>R4, R5]
    Form --> Add[Add, change or remove add-ons per class<br/>R6]
    Cls --> Form
    Add --> Form
    Form -- Avbryt --> Table
    Form -- Spara --> Rules{Name, at least one class,<br/>unique name?<br/>R7}
    Rules -- no --> Err[Error message in the form]
    Err --> Form
    Rules -- yes --> Save[Whole aircraft saved in one transaction<br/>R10] --> Table
    Trash --> Flights{Has flights?}
    Flights -- yes --> Blocked[Du kan ej ta bort]
    Blocked --> Table
    Flights -- no --> Sure{Är du säker?}
    Sure -- Nej --> Table
    Sure -- Ja --> Del[Deleted, its routes get no aircraft] --> Table
